ariant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520315009:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog116>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26B50C01B0094F63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520315010:0":{"text":"저기가 좋겠어요. 허니리프베어와 너무 가깝지도, 너무 멀지도 않아서 미끼 냄새에 분명 끌려들 거예요.","source_cn":"那个位置就很好，距离那些叶角熊不近不远，食物的香气肯定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B3C3E74B94280F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:20::0":{"text":"루나애니의 음식","source_cn":"兽人食物","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F99DB3999BD3D5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1520315011:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">미끼를 저기에 두고</style>, <style=\"highlight\">제스처로 허니리프베어를 유인하는 거예요</style>. 허니리프베어가 미끼에 정신이 팔렸을 때, 재빨리 달려간다면 안전하게 가져올 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"只要<style=highlight>把食物放在那里<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6A0B3F4835A31E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1520315012:0":{"text":"허니리프베어는 제가 잘 알고 있거든요! 허니리프베어의 가장 큰 특징이 바로 식탐이에요!","source_cn":"我很了解这些叶角熊，它们最大的特点就是贪吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x502128E6049AE1F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520315013:0":{"text":"허니리프베어가 미끼를 향해 달려가면, 제가 <style=\"highlight\">근처의 넝쿨을 타고 내려가서</style> 낙엽초를 가지고 돌아오면 돼요!","source_cn":"等叶角熊被引开之后，我就<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA97D312D5538C862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1520315014:0":{"text":"넝쿨을 타다니... 높은데 괜찮겠어요?","source_cn":"爬藤蔓……不恐高吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E7C81AA2F2E6772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1520315015:0":{"text":"넝쿨은 벽과 붙어있는 데다가, 높은 곳에서 오랫동안 머물지 않을거라... 괜찮을 거예요.","source_cn":"那、那块藤蔓靠墙，我也不需要在高处待多长时间……肯定没问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBAD28B42DD750F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1520315016:0":{"text":"그러고보니... 예전에 넝쿨에 탔을 때는 왜 고소공포증을 못 느꼈을까요?","source_cn":"说起来……为什么我以前爬藤蔓的时候没觉得恐高呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD631B10F3E694E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1520315017:0":{"text":"그리고 마지막에 여기서 모이는 거죠.\n신속하고 안전하게 빠져나가는 거예요!","source_cn":"最后，我们就在这里汇合。\\n迅速撤离，全身而退！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A7D94711B7F09A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1520315018:0":{"text":"어때요? 간단하지만 확실한 계획이죠?","source_cn":"怎么样？是不是一个又棒又简单的计划？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B1C02ACAD5BD884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:38:1520315018":{"text":"어때요? 간단하지만 확실한 계획이죠?","source_cn":"怎么样？是不是一个又棒又简单的计划？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B1C02ACAD5BD884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1520315019:0":{"text":"혼자서는 시간이 오래 걸릴 거예요... 저는 지붕을 빨리 고치고 싶거든요!","source_cn":"一个人要花很长时间……我是为了尽快修好屋顶！嗯，就是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D94E7C7943C0E45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1520315021:0":{"text":"그럼 작전을 시작할게요!","source_cn":"来吧！行动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C72D2EEC805AAA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:1502071503:0":{"text":"마지막으로, 과르가 안전한 곳을 가리켰다.","source_cn":"最后，果指了一个安全的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A44C6B0FE22D0BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t